              "developer_general_contact": "Skylight Real Estate Partners \u2014 27 Union Square West, Suite 503, New York, NY 10003 | 212-886-7700; Cannon Hill Capital Partners \u2014 info@cannonhillcap.com | +1 (212) 763-1440 | 76 Eighth Avenue, 2nd Floor, New York, NY 10011",
              "developer_contact_path": "Start with Skylight's Union Square headquarters and reference the 101 Franklin / 250 Church condo-conversion project; route residential go-to-market decisions to Russell Tepper at Skylight Residential Group, use Skylight's officially listed Danny Reed (Senior Development Manager) or Ewelina Ottenbreit (Director of Construction Management) as the cleanest public execution-side follow-up when timing/design coordination matters, and escalate owner-side construction/development approvals to Jesse Laserson at Cannon Hill. Corcoran Sunshine remains the publicly named downstream sales layer rather than the first sponsor touch.",
              "decision_maker_notes": "Skylight's live homepage still exposes Russell Tepper as President of Skylight Residential Group plus the Union Square office line, and it also names Danny Reed (Senior Development Manager) and Ewelina Ottenbreit (Director of Construction Management) as useful public execution-side follow-ups. Cannon Hill's rendered team/contact pages continue to add Jesse Laserson and a live Chelsea office line, so the JV now has a clearer sponsor/owner routing stack without forcing everything through the future broker layer.",
              "outreach_priority": "A"
