              "developer_contact_path": "Start with Settlement Housing Fund's main office and cite the 50-58 Cliff Street affordable tower JV with Trinity Church; route first to Judy Herbstman for sponsor-level approvals and to Graikelis (Kelly) Morales as SHF's chief operating officer for execution / organizational follow-through. Use marketinginfo@shfinc.org only for downstream housing-application or lease-up questions. If owner-side escalation is needed, use Trinity's public general-inquiries line and note Thehbia Hiwot as the housing-and-homelessness initiative lead rather than treating Trinity as the primary first-touch route.",
