              "developer_contact_path": "Use Toll Brothers City Living's official contact form and cite the 118 Tenth Avenue / West Chelsea condo site directly. Route buyer-facing or general project outreach through the form's Sales Question path, use Michael J. Duff for general inquiries or press questions because the live form maps both of those options to mduff@tollbrothers.com, and use Alan Silver for parcel / site-routing escalation because the same official form maps Sell Land inquiries to asilver@tollbrothers.com. Keep David von Spreckelsen only as the division-president backstop if the inquiry clearly needs executive approval beyond the public routing matrix.",
              "decision_maker_notes": "This pass tightened the row around Toll Brothers City Living's own routing stack instead of leaning on generic parent-company assumptions. The official About page names David von Spreckelsen as president, Alan Silver as vice president, Brendan Walsh as director of construction, and Michael J. Duff as senior director of marketing, while the live contact form exposes a usable inquiry matrix: General Inquiries and Press Question both route to mduff@tollbrothers.com, and Sell Land routes to asilver@tollbrothers.com. That makes Alan Silver a more operational public second contact for the parcel than keeping only the division president in the main stack.",
