              "source_excerpt": "StudiosC says 345 East 17th Street is a 13-story ground-up residential development whose double-height lobby, second-floor amenity space facing the street, landscaped terraces, and lounges are meant to enrich the pedestrian experience while reinterpreting Gramercy's brick-and-metal architectural fabric with modern restraint.",
