              "decision_maker_notes": "Minrav official pages make the public routing cleaner than the older row suggested. The Management page names Ori Arison as CEO of Minrav Real-Estate and Avi Ben Zaken as VP Business Development for Minrav Group, which is a better second sponsor-side escalation than the generic group-CEO fallback when the goal is future project, partner, or rollout outreach. The official contact form also exposes both \"Minrav Real Estate\" and a separate \"Marketing\" department selector, so future outreach can shift from development routing to public-launch routing without leaving the official site.",
